/-!
# Lower bounds for the first autocorrelation constant: the certificate-independent part

`lake build` checks this part: the analytic reduction (`Autocorr.autocorr_lower_of_halfClaim`, with the
essential-supremum and real-valued forms), the soundness of the native checkers (`halfClaim_of_covered`,
`halfClaim_of_coveredX`) and of the kernel checker (`AutocorrK.stkK_sound`, `AutocorrK.halfClaim_of_rootK`).
The per-certificate modules are generated by the exporters in `tools/` and built by `tools/build_dag.py`.
-/
